# Infant Yogurt Pancakes

Based on [Mom’s on Call](https://momsoncall.com) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251123153636/https://momsoncall.com/))

{ rating="4" image="infant_pancakes.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 cups [flour]{ ing="flour" }
- [ ] 3/4 tsp [baking powder]{ ing="baking-powder" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [whole milk]{ ing="whole-milk" } (or skim milk + small sliver of butter)
- [ ] 1/2 cup [whole milk vanilla yogurt]{ ing="whole-milk-vanilla-yogurt" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp of [pureed fruit]{ ing="pureed-fruit" }
- [ ] [Pureed fruit]{ ing="pureed-fruit" }, for serving (optional)

## Recipe

1. Mix dry ingredients and then add the rest
1. Make 12 1/8 cup pancakes or larger ones up 1/4 cup
1. Flip once starting to become a darker yellow around the edges
